# Production build-time env for Vite. These VITE_* values are PUBLIC by design
# (they are embedded in the client bundle), so committing them is safe and makes
# the production build self-contained instead of depending on Vercel env vars
# that were empty at build time (which left Clerk with no key -> stuck on
# "Loading..." and the API pointing at localhost:3001).
